{"4958560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Helsinki Online", "steam_appid": 4958560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helsinki Online</strong> is an experimental open-world online game set in Helsinki. Roam the city on foot, behind the wheel, or in the air, and create your own lasting mark on it with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Helsinki</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire city is very playable. Every tree, bench, bin and path are exactly where they really are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the city from the eyes of a Human, or a goose. The archenemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online multiplayer - play with friends in the same world. Build a sauna ferry together and sail the archipelago!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early development</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helsinki Online is in active development. Features, balance, and visuals will change. Wishlist to follow updates :)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helsinki Online</strong> is an experimental open-world online game set in Helsinki. Roam the city on foot, behind the wheel, or in the air, and create your own lasting mark on it with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Helsinki</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire city is very playable. Every tree, bench, bin and path are exactly where they really are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the city from the eyes of a Human, or a goose. The archenemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online multiplayer - play with friends in the same world. Build a sauna ferry together and sail the archipelago!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early development</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helsinki Online is in active development. Features, balance, and visuals will change. Wishlist to follow updates :)</p>", "short_description": "Open-world online game set in Helsinki. Drive, fly as a bird, build, and explore the city with friends.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958560/075807bfa305a3d57059082494a70b190b685c1b/header.jpg?t=1786268883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958560/01a2e582b02f7ccc086f2680fd75e3a2aee180e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786268883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958560/01a2e582b02f7ccc086f2680fd75e3a2aee180e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786268883", "website": "https://www.helsinkionlinegame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> \t Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \t DirectX 11 compatible GPU with 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> An SSD is recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6-core CPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended for smoother world loading. A stable connection improves online play.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_r